{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "ff6481c5573688bb8b9bb771e3975bc6d1b447c508acc95666d93a7fd1c02657", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ！\nおつかれさまです！", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生！\n你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8dbf6db26aec17e7c1613843ea26e89fc07ef14b882f41383ecb885a2af1f61a", "ja": "お疲れさま、育。ちょうどよかった。\nその衣装のブログ記事のことなんだけど。", "zh": "辛苦了，育，你来得正好。\n关于你在部落格提到那套服装的文章……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "bd06acb7dcd47ac548b7d4a9606682b1cefa48d6cf516e6d79f7e018f9300a56", "ja": "ブログ……？\nあっ、この衣装をもらったときの？", "zh": "部落格……？\n啊，你是说刚拿到这套服装时的文章？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1003_p", "source_sha256": "10aa550488ded7b5d045796683643ece2b7d7225d723a1feb11d5d44e7dcaeb7", "ja": "ああ。楽しそうな内容で、よく書けてたよ。\n育のファンからも、評判がいいみたいだ。", "zh": "嗯，内容看起来很开心，写得很好喔。\n在育的粉丝间也大受好评呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "6d35a94aaf6300be204b81c8910a7cc52adeb5351ee607ac8a337f3d4ef87230", "ja": "わあっ、{$P$}さん、ほんとう？\nよかった！　わたし、学校の作文は得意なんだ！", "zh": "哇啊，{$P$}先生，真的吗？\n太好了！作文可是我在学校的拿手科目呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b176d8c330275a5b3c8ab5c30ad7ec64fba22df444c4ac8e272ecf088e702f35", "ja": "そうか、頼もしいな。\nもしかして、今日もブログ用か？", "zh": "是这样啊，真可靠呢。\n你今天该不会也为了部落格在准备题材？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "bf7ac8450c023858989baa0cdc99f2d361a635114805b1cd127e557ba162ab8f", "ja": "ううん。あのね、この衣装すっごく気に入ったから、\nきめポーズを考えてたの！", "zh": "不是的。那个啊，因为我很喜欢这套服装，\n所以正在想招牌姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "00dccf1f6f62d436958b9f5423d6710fe5599765438b077b611f801ce1e6f67e", "ja": "えっと、こういうのとか……こんなのとか！\nどう？　わたし、きまってる？", "zh": "我想想，像这样子……或那样子！\n怎么样？我是不是很有架势？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0e4e89d5f593a6887bb0e618c9a6d9a2c868fa720aae0118c997dd076487986b", "ja": "なるほど、決めポーズの研究をしてたのか。\nうん、いいんじゃないか。サマになってるよ。", "zh": "原来如此，你在研究招牌姿势啊。\n嗯，感觉不错，很有模有样喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "08279e4e048e45115b35ca5055df5842bc73790c63fba17370e93edb3a13a870", "ja": "えへへ、やったあ♪　{$P$}さん、\nわたし、もっともっと練習するね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪{$P$}先生，\n我会更加、更加努力练习的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "426f5b7e5d8d589a7e9c65985555e0091ec36fad7f8a80e994a03cf8ef894dad", "ja": "桃子ちゃんもね、カッコイイきめポーズが、\nすぐにできるんだよ。わたし、見習わなきゃ！", "zh": "桃子总是能一下子就能摆出帅气的招牌姿势喔。\n我要向她看齐才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0e0c79b558633693158298b454d87f6b89fb0618a7283dea20c39aaea9d3a9b3", "ja": "そうか……育と桃子は友達だけど、\n良きライバルでもあるんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……虽然育和桃子是好朋友，\n但同时也是好对手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "c779a7d2feb560d795cdfafd5fc1e5913694ca14a242326fb7160c6bf797723a", "ja": "うん！　桃子ちゃんもがんばってるし、\nわたしもがんばらなくちゃだよね！", "zh": "嗯！桃子她很努力，\n我也得好好加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "f585c805c20a24b1fa72ddf5c84ed5afa80597c4da761a4d346a3c6a479af483", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　ねえ{$P$}さん、\nわたし、いろんなポーズが知りたいな！", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生，\n我想学学各种不同的姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "d33922f21c71b13dc51073e839c33f108c8d2f03f300201564e016cc039a4aed", "ja": "{$P$}さんなら、知ってるよね？\nかわいいのとか、大人っぽいの、やってみせて？", "zh": "{$P$}先生应该很懂吧？\n摆点可爱或成熟的姿势给我看嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3e90e0bcc05471af7ea27ba0258e46820a1321de1783d8c7def7dd1aa556b4d7", "ja": "えっ？　お、俺がやるのか？", "zh": "咦？我、我来摆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "5275007337869e8c5cf29b3f30acc5b61d6824449dd0e0cf580a5259f358e507", "ja": "だって、お手本がないとわからないんだもん。\n{$P$}さん、お願い！", "zh": "因为没范本的话很难懂啊。\n{$P$}先生，拜托你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0044_1017_p", "source_sha256": "19bf1a322716416c7f4bd5904ca8a8cbf4dbf613a6c4debd0b89fee96770f0e4", "ja": "（その後のレッスンで、育は納得のいく決めポーズを\n習得したらしい。……手伝ったかいがあったな！）", "zh": "（在之后的训练课程中，育似乎顺利学到\n让她满意的招牌姿势了……看来我的帮忙没有白费呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
